<title>CHINA: Wah Tak Fung announces 1st final results.</title>
<headline>Wah Tak Fung announces 1st final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   20.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.4</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    99.60</p>
<p>    Turnover		     117.46</p>
<p>    Company name		 Wah Tak Fung Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 18-24</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   September 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Property group Wah Tak Fung was listed on September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 3.4 H.K. cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
